# The topics the lessons teach, and where: the prerequisite graph's vocabulary.
#
# slug | title | lesson id (@modes if taught only in a mode section) | the lesson's ## heading, or -
#
# A heading of - is the lesson's opening, the paragraphs before its first ## heading. A lesson's
# front matter `requires:` lists the topics it leans on and does not teach. Each topic is taught once,
# in the section named; the learning page links a required topic back to that section.
# tools/graph.py (run by make check) refuses an unknown slug, a heading not in its lesson, a lesson
# requiring a topic it teaches, and a cycle between lessons. Audited 2026-10-07 by four non-author
# readers against every line of the 28 lessons (docs/evidence/graph-audit.md).

